:0.0954,"r5_spy":0.0267,"r20_spy":0.0468,"r1_sector":0.1,"r5_sector":0.0045,"r20_sector":-0.018,"etf":"XLK"}}],"quotes":[{"c":"GTLB 2026 Q1","e":"gtlb","d":"2025-06-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"William Staples","x":"They selected GitLab Premium and Duo Pro to build an internal software acceleration program targeting 2X faster feature development for their end-to-end AI infrastructure solutions.","url":"https://s204.q4cdn.com/984476563/files/doc_financials/2026/q1/CORRECTED-TRANSCRIPT_-Gitlab-Inc-GTLB-US-Q1-2026-Earnings-Call-10-June-2025-4_30-PM-ET.pdf"},{"c":"GTLB 2026 Q1","e":"gtlb","d":"2025-06-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Brian G. Robins","x":"We ended the quarter with $1.1 billion in cash and investments, providing us with significant flexibility to navigate market fluctuations while continuing to invest in both our AI capabilities, platform enhancements and go-to-market organization.","url":"https://s204.q4cdn.com/984476563/files/doc_financials/2026/q1/CORRECTED-TRANSCRIPT_-Gitlab-Inc-GTLB-US-Q1-2026-Earnings-Call-10-June-2025-4_30-PM-ET.pdf"},{"c":"GTLB 2026 Q1","e":"gtlb","d":"2025-06-10","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Brian G. Robins","x":"And only on a couple occasions has it come up that tariffs, people were contemplating delaying.","url":"https://s204.q4cdn.com/984476563/files/doc_financials/2026/q1/CORRECTED-TRANSCRIPT_-Gitlab-Inc-GTLB-US-Q1-2026-Earnings-Call-10-June-2025-4_30-PM-ET.pdf"},{"c":"GTLB 2026 Q1","e":"gtlb","d":"2025-06-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Staples","x":"In addition to GitLab Ultimate, they chose Duo Enterprise to power AI development capabilities and streamline workflows.","url":"https://s204.q4cdn.com/984476563/files/doc_financials/2026/q1/CORRECTED-TRANSCRIPT_-Gitlab-Inc-GTLB-US-Q1-2026-Earnings-Call-10-June-2025-4_30-PM-ET.pdf"},{"c":"GTLB 2026 Q1","e":"gtlb","d":"2025-06-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Staples","x":"Dedicated will enable them to streamline their highly complex environment and reduce R&D overhead costs.","url":"https://s204.q4cdn.com/984476563/files/doc_financials/2026/q1/CORRECTED-TRANSCRIPT_-Gitlab-Inc-GTLB-US-Q1-2026-Earnings-Call-10-June-2025-4_30-PM-ET.pdf"},{"c":"GTLB 2026 Q2","e":"gtlb","d":"2025-09-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Brian Robins","x":"We ended the quarter with $1.2 billion in cash and investments, providing us with a significant flexibility to navigate market fluctuations while continuing to invest in both our AI capabilities platform enhancements and go-to-market organization.","url":"https://s204.q4cdn.com/984476563/files/doc_downloads/09/GTLB-USQ_Transcript_2025-09-03.pdf"},{"c":"GTLB 2026 Q2","e":"gtlb","d":"2025-09-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brian Robins","x":"Less than 10% of the FY26 revenue growth was derived from the premium price increase.","url":"https://s204.q4cdn.com/984476563/files/doc_downloads/09/GTLB-USQ_Transcript_2025-09-03.pdf"},{"c":"GTLB 2026 Q2","e":"gtlb","d":"2025-09-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brian Robins","x":"Since we did the price increase, we talked about the SMB being a little bit more price sensitive.","url":"https://s204.q4cdn.com/984476563/files/doc_downloads/09/GTLB-USQ_Transcript_2025-09-03.pdf"},{"c":"GTLB 2026 Q3","e":"gtlb","d":"2025-12-02","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Yao Chew","x":"We'll be live streaming a product-specific event in February where more details will be made available.","url":"https://s204.q4cdn.com/984476563/files/doc_financials/2026/q3/GTLB-USQ_Transcript_2025-12-02.pdf"},{"c":"GTLB 2026 Q3","e":"gtlb","d":"2025-12-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Yao Chew","x":"They're all spending on some form of AI tooling in their engineering org, but they continue to use GitLab as the backbone of their SDLC.","url":"https://s204.q4cdn.com/984476563/files/doc_financials/2026/q3/GTLB-USQ_Transcript_2025-12-02.pdf"},{"c":"GTLB 2026 Q3","e":"gtlb","d":"2025-12-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Yao Chew","x":"We continue to invest across three pillars: Core DevOps, security, and AI.","url":"https://s204.q4cdn.com/984476563/files/doc_financials/2026/q3/GTLB-USQ_Transcript_2025-12-02.pdf"},{"c":"GTLB 2026 Q3","e":"gtlb","d":"2025-12-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Yao Chew","x":"While we aren't providing guidance for FY27, I would remind you for modeling purposes that the April FY24 premium price increase has now been largely implemented and will not be a discrete tailwind in FY27.","url":"https://s204.q4cdn.com/984476563/files/doc_financials/2026/q3/GTLB-USQ_Transcript_2025-12-02.pdf"},{"c":"GTLB 2026 Q3","e":"gtlb","d":"2025-12-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"James Wood","x":"…from Wells Fargo, followed by Jason Celino from KeyBanc. (inaudible) So now that you're past the price increase and you're adding more features onto your more premium plans and since you've seen competitors for their higher-end plans like cursor and (inaudible) come in at $200 a month for those…","url":"https://s204.q4cdn.com/984476563/files/doc_financials/2026/q3/GTLB-USQ_Transcript_2025-12-02.pdf"},{"c":"GTLB 2026 Q4","e":"gtlb","d":"2026-03-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bill Staples","x":"…with the privacy and security concerns with their business, the increased costs and expense of investing in AI versus other traditional workloads. What is interesting is I think there is a ton of experimentation going, and, obviously, early results are really promising within certain…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/03/gitlab-gtlb-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTLB 2026 Q4","e":"gtlb","d":"2026-03-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bill Staples","x":"Our 50% Premium price increase a few years ago also coincided with rising AI code experimentation and flattish SaaS budgets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/03/gitlab-gtlb-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTLB 2026 Q4","e":"gtlb","d":"2026-03-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jessica Ross","x":"In order of magnitude, these include the Premium price increase from three years ago, positive FX dynamics, and specific clauses in certain customer contracts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/03/gitlab-gtlb-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTLB 2026 Q4","e":"gtlb","d":"2026-03-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jessica Ross","x":"For example, there was one retailer that had some Q4 challenges and another large customer that had some layoffs and restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/03/gitlab-gtlb-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTLB 2026 Q4","e":"gtlb","d":"2026-03-03","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Sanjit Singh","x":"And I guess the context that I am thinking about is that the coding agents, the popular coding agents, a lot of them are still seat-based pricing, whether it is $20 a month or higher.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/03/gitlab-gtlb-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTLB 2027 Q1","e":"gtlb","d":"2026-06-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"William Staples","x":"DAP is unlocking access to incremental AI budgets beyond existing DevSecOps spend.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/03/gitlab-gtlb-q1-2027-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GTLB 2027 Q1","e":"gtlb","d":"2026-06-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"William Staples","x":"AI scale workloads added to Zillow's coding agent providers and Zillow's internal agents have meant fundamentally different infrastructure needs as AI-assisted workflows help engineering teams ship 40% more code per engineer and focus on broader development priorities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/03/gitlab-gtlb-q1-2027-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GTLB 2027 Q1","e":"gtlb","d":"2026-06-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Staples","x":"Jessica will get into the details of the financial aspect of the restructuring shortly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/03/gitlab-gtlb-q1-2027-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GTLB 2027 Q1","e":"gtlb","d":"2026-06-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jessica Ross","x":"Across the business, we saw more seat contraction than we anticipated, mostly tied to layoffs in our customer base.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/03/gitlab-gtlb-q1-2027-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GTLB 2027 Q1","e":"gtlb","d":"2026-06-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jessica Ross","x":"Given our Q1 performance and the continued progress we are making across many of our 5 strategic priorities, we are raising our guidance for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/03/gitlab-gtlb-q1-2027-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GTLB 2027 Q1","e":"gtlb","d":"2026-06-02","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"William Staples","x":"Code generation is commoditizing fast and enterprise AI bills are climbing as fast as adoption.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/03/gitlab-gtlb-q1-2027-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GTLB 2027 Q1","e":"gtlb","d":"2026-06-02","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Ethan Drake Weeks","x":"And there's been some worries in the past around these AI labs looking to kind of do this in-house or become competitive with you.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/03/gitlab-gtlb-q1-2027-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GTLB 2027 Q2","e":"gtlb","d":"2026-09-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jessica Ross","x":"We incurred approximately $23.3 million in restructuring charges, in line with what we outlined last quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/08/gitlab-gtlb-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTLB 2027 Q2","e":"gtlb","d":"2026-09-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jessica Ross","x":"With these points in mind, I am pleased to share that we are raising our guidance to reflect the strong momentum we experienced in the first half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/08/gitlab-gtlb-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTLB 2027 Q2","e":"gtlb","d":"2026-09-01","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"William Staples","x":"Our seat based business continues to grow, and AI is creating an additional opportunity for GitLab to monetize an increasing amount of work happening across the software life cycle.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/08/gitlab-gtlb-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[61,1,8434,0,0,0,6420,1469],[62,1,9443,0,0,0,7413,1583],[63,1,8315,0,0,0,3339,4895],[64,1,9018,0,0,0,8911,0],[65,1,7975,0,0,0,7779,100],[66,1,8744,0,0,0,2373,5353]],"cinema":[[61,1,8434,0,0,0,6420,1469],[62,1,9443,0,0,0,7413,1583],[63,1,8315,0,0,0,3339,4895],[64,1,9018,0,0,0,8911,0],[65,1,7975,0,0,0,7779,100],[66,1,8744,0,0,0,2373,5353]],"imax":[[61,1,8434,0,0,0,6420,1469],[62,1,9443,0,0,0,7413,1583],[63,1,8315,0,0,0,3339,4895],[64,1,9018,0,0,0,8911,0],[65,1,7975,0,0,0,7779,100],[66,1,8744,0,0,0,2373,5353]],"streaming":[[61,1,8434,0,0,0,6420,1469],[62,1,9443,0,0,0,7413,1583],[63,1,8315,1,1,0,3339,4895],[64,1,9018,0,0,0,8911,0],[65,1,7975,0,0,0,7779,100],[66,1,8744,0,0,0,2373,5353]],"dtc":[[61,1,8434,0,0,0,6420,1469],[62,1,9443,0,0,0,7413,1583],[63,1,8315,0,0,0,3339,4895],[64,1,9018,0,0,0,8911,0],[65,1,7975,0,0,0,7779,100],[66,1,8744,0,0,0,2373,5353]],"ai_spend":[[61,1,8434,2,2,0,6420,1469],[62,1,9443,1,1,0,7413,1583],[63,1,8315,3,3,0,3339,4895],[64,1,9018,1,1,0,8911,0],[65,1,7975,6,6,0,7779,100],[66,1,8744,1,0,0,2373,5353]],"tariffs":[[61,1,8434,1,1,0,6420,1469],[62,1,9443,0,0,0,7413,1583],[63,1,8315,0,0,0,3339,4895],[64,1,9018,0,0,0,8911,0],[65,1,7975,0,0,0,7779,100],[66,1,8744,0,0,0,2373,5353]],"pricing_power":[[61,1,8434,0,0,0,6420,1469],[62,1,944